## Interface: 16001
## Title: Better Forever
## Notes: Small fixes for the WoW Forever client: FPS counter after login and reload, creature type in tooltips and as an icon on nameplates, an indicator while the wand is shooting, a Soul Shard reaper for warlocks, and a Cinematic Ultra switch (17 graphics console variables, your own values saved first). Options under AddOns > Better Forever, or /bb.
